          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Most sunscreens protect you from the sun while quietly working against everything else. Chemical filters that absorb into your skin. Synthetic compounds that disrupt your microbiome. Ingredients that don't belong in your body or the ocean.</p>"
