      "blocks": {
        "text_HNWRhN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Oxybenzone and octinoxate are the two most common chemical UV filters and they are banned in Hawaii under Act 104 because of the damage they cause to coral reefs. Most sunscreens still contain them and most people have no idea.</p>"
